  Moloch{} is a fork of the popular, but unmaintained, LaTeX
  Beamer{} theme Metropolis{}. It fixes outstanding issues in
  Metropolis{} while preserving the original minimalist design. In this
  article we introduce Moloch{}'s features and options, provide guidance
  for Metropolis{} users transitioning to Moloch{}, and describe
  the documentation system that we use to generate both PDF and HTML
  documentation.
